## Recipe
1. Add temp 2s delay to the target `lazy()` import (one at a time keeps it clear).
2. `pnpm dev`
3. Trigger the row, watch the fallback, screenshot.
4. Check Done + confirm pass criteria (fills, no flash, no shift).
5. Revert the temp delay before moving on.
